  "comment": "kiln.stations (in kiln-items.dll): the production stations of a base (FactoryStation entities) and the game's own station actions. player_crafting's PlayerCraftingAction dispatch (types 2 select recipe / resume, 4 stop: plain FactoryStation writes after ServerFactoryInfo invalidation; type 1 AutomaticTransfer = the 'fill from chests' button), the fill core AutoTransferRecipe (tx, base stock, resolved inputs, station, u16 crafts, waterCharges, player), recipe-input resolution with category selections (ResolveRecipeInputs / ResolveInput / FindInputCategory over RecipeRegistry+0xA0), PlayerBasesSystem's base lookup by position and per-base stock lists (InventoryCraftingStock containers +0x30, water sources +0x58, stride 0x130), factory_station's start and completion, the factory speed getter. Identical code on server 26430253 and client 26430625 (one file for both). Evidence: docs/re/stations.md.",
